      'The peak-end rule means success states and task completion moments disproportionately determine overall satisfaction — invest in them accordingly.',
      'Supporting Dynamic Type, VoiceOver/TalkBack labels, and sufficient color contrast are the highest-impact accessibility improvements for most mobile apps.',
      'A design system\'s value is documentation and governance, not just component files — undocumented components are used inconsistently regardless of how well they are designed.',
